{"real": false, "dur": 69.29, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 2.32, "text": "This is where FluOLinGo began.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "where", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "began.", "s": 1.94}]}, {"start": 2.67, "end": 6.13, "text": "It teaches beginner French using our course book, L’Atelier.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 2.67}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "beginner", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "French", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "using", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "our", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "course", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "book,", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "L’Atelier.", "s": 5.75}]}, {"start": 6.48, "end": 14.95, "text": "In the first version, I cut the course into fifty small goals across five units and laid them out on a map.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 6.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.87}, {"w": "first", "s": 7.25}, {"w": "version,", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "I", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "cut", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "course", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "into", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "small", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "goals", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "across", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "five", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "units", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "and", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "laid", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "them", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "out", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "on", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "a", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "map.", "s": 14.56}]}, {"start": 15.3, "end": 20.3, "text": "That’s the left side of the slide: fifty numbered goals in a row.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "left", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "side", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "of", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "slide:", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "numbered", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "goals", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "a", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "row.", "s": 19.91}]}, {"start": 20.65, "end": 22.95, "text": "Every exercise belonged to a goal.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 20.65}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 21.03}, {"w": "belonged", "s": 21.42}, {"w": "to", "s": 21.8}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "goal.", "s": 22.57}]}, {"start": 23.3, "end": 28.69, "text": "In other words, I started with the goal, then built the exercises around it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "other", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "words,", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "started", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "the", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "goal,", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "then", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "built", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.15}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 27.53}, {"w": "around", "s": 27.92}, {"w": "it.", "s": 28.3}]}, {"start": 29.04, "end": 31.73, "text": "But look at three of those goals.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "look", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "at", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "three", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "of", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "those", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 31.35}]}, {"start": 32.08, "end": 34.0, "text": "Number twenty-eight, negation, is linguistic.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "twenty-eight,", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "negation,", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "is", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "linguistic.", "s": 33.62}]}, {"start": 34.35, "end": 38.58, "text": "Number twenty-nine, inviting someone and turning down an invitation, is communicative.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "twenty-nine,", "s": 34.74}, {"w": "inviting", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "someone", "s": 35.51}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.89}, {"w": "turning", "s": 36.28}, {"w": "down", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "an", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "invitation,", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "is", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "communicative.", "s": 38.2}]}, {"start": 38.93, "end": 42.4, "text": "Number thirty, writing an email, is a whole task.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 38.93}, {"w": "thirty,", "s": 39.32}, {"w": "writing", "s": 39.7}, {"w": "an", "s": 40.09}, {"w": "email,", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "is", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "a", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "whole", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "task.", "s": 42.01}]}, {"start": 42.75, "end": 45.82, "text": "On the map, they all looked the same.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 42.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.13}, {"w": "map,", "s": 43.52}, {"w": "they", "s": 43.9}, {"w": "all", "s": 44.28}, {"w": "looked", "s": 44.67}, {"w": "the", "s": 45.05}, {"w": "same.", "s": 45.44}]}, {"start": 46.17, "end": 50.4, "text": "It was planning the Chinese version that made me notice this.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 46.17}, {"w": "was", "s": 46.56}, {"w": "planning", "s": 46.94}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.33}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 47.71}, {"w": "version", "s": 48.1}, {"w": "that", "s": 48.48}, {"w": "made", "s": 48.87}, {"w": "me", "s": 49.25}, {"w": "notice", "s": 49.63}, {"w": "this.", "s": 50.02}]}, {"start": 50.75, "end": 53.45, "text": "On the right is the revised structure.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 50.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.14}, {"w": "right", "s": 51.52}, {"w": "is", "s": 51.91}, {"w": "the", "s": 52.29}, {"w": "revised", "s": 52.68}, {"w": "structure.", "s": 53.06}]}, {"start": 53.8, "end": 61.87, "text": "Each unit now has three kinds of step: linguistic goals, the situations that use them, and one task at the end.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 53.8}, {"w": "unit", "s": 54.18}, {"w": "now", "s": 54.57}, {"w": "has", "s": 54.95}, {"w": "three", "s": 55.33}, {"w": "kinds", "s": 55.72}, {"w": "of", "s": 56.1}, {"w": "step:", "s": 56.49}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 56.87}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 57.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.64}, {"w": "situations", "s": 58.03}, {"w": "that", "s": 58.41}, {"w": "use", "s": 58.8}, {"w": "them,", "s": 59.18}, {"w": "and", "s": 59.57}, {"w": "one", "s": 59.95}, {"w": "task", "s": 60.33}, {"w": "at", "s": 60.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.1}, {"w": "end.", "s": 61.49}]}, {"start": 62.22, "end": 64.53, "text": "Only the first two are goals.", "words": [{"w": "Only", "s": 62.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 62.61}, {"w": "first", "s": 62.99}, {"w": "two", "s": 63.38}, {"w": "are", "s": 63.76}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 64.15}]}, {"start": 64.88, "end": 68.34, "text": "And you’ll see that same 